Analysis of design points for curved continuous steel box girders
Liu Weichang
Shandong Provincial Communications Planning and Design Institute Group Co. Ltd. Jinan Shandong 250031 China
Abstract Due to the advantages of low structural height large span capacity light self-weight high bending and torsional
stiffness high strength and fast construction speed steel box girders are increasingly used in large-span curved bridges. Due
to the complex stress state of curved bridges which are in a complex state of bending shear and torsion detailed calculations
should be carried out during the design process. Through engineering examples a detailed study is conducted on the design and
calculation points of curved steel box girders providing reference and inspiration for the design of similar bridges.
Key words curved continuous steel box girder plate
