Research on risk assessment of subway shield
construction based on AHP and improved grey clustering method★
Yang Pengfei
Gansu Vocational College of Architecture Lanzhou Gansu 730050 China
Abstract The risk assessment index system of subway shield construction on water-rich sand and gravel stratum was deter
mined by conducting in-depth research sorting out and classifying various indexes. The weights of criterion layer and index
layer in the evaluation index system were determined by analytic hierarchy process. The improved grey cluster risk model of
subway shield construction based on mixed possibility function of central point was constructed by dividing grey class construc
ting improved possibility function calculating comprehensive clustering coefficient and determining risk level etc. . Finally
the project example was analyzed and evaluated. It is proved that the method is scientific and can be extended.
Key words water-rich sand pebble shield construction AHP grey clustering risk assessment
